{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19103370","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19103370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910337001:1":{"text":"왜 이제 왔어? 조금만 더 늦었으면 너희 없이 회유 의식을 시작할 뻔했잖아.","source_cn":"你们怎么现在才来呀？再晚一点，洄游仪式就要先开始啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x193B69B6A62D1F65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910337002:1":{"text":"우리 없이 시작한다고? 오늘 주인공은 나랑 덩치 아니었어?","source_cn":"你们先开始？喂，今天的主角不是咱和大个子吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D950D7B9584E154","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910337003:1":{"text":"오늘은 회유기가 시작되는 날이잖아. 너희 말고도 아주 많은 새로운 가족을 맞이해야 하거든.","source_cn":"今天是洄游季开始的日子，除了你们，还要迎来很多很多其他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09072DF57EB6F949","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910337004:1":{"text":"봐, 첫 번째는 광채 가문이야! 올해 양분을 많이 모아서 곧 타라사에 새로운 생명을 탄생시킬 수 있을 거래.","source_cn":"看，首先是砗光家族！他们今年收集了很多养料，马上就能为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAF96EA353840F22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1910337004":{"text":"봐, 첫 번째는 광채 가문이야! 올해 양분을 많이 모아서 곧 타라사에 새로운 생명을 탄생시킬 수 있을 거래.","source_cn":"看，首先是砗光家族！他们今年收集了很多养料，马上就能为塔拉萨迎来新的生命了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAF96EA353840F22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910337005:1":{"text":"당연하지! 여기는 탄생의 연못이잖아. 모든 새로운 생명은 여기서 태어나는 걸.","source_cn":"当然啦！这里是繁育池，所有新生命都是从这里诞生的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1017E59BDEE973CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910337006:1":{"text":"뭐? 지금? 여기서? 사람이 이렇게 많은데?!","source_cn":"啥？！现在？立刻？在这么多人面前？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84C2BFE338CDA208","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910337007:1":{"text":"응, 회유기는 원래 그런 거잖아? 너희도 이따가 회유 의식에 참가해야 하는데... 왜 그런 이상한 표정을 지어?","source_cn":"对啊，洄游季不就是这样吗？你们等等也要参加洄游仪式的…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3C24E3126EFEE07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910337011:1":{"text":"잠깐, 잠깐만! 나 완전히 헷갈리기 시작했어!","source_cn":"等等、等等！咱彻底混乱了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36B623F4B1237EB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910337012:1":{"text":"회유 의식이 대체 뭔데? 도대체 뭘 해야 하는 거야?","source_cn":"洄游仪式是啥玩意儿，咱到底要参加啥？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26B0E21A298FD4E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910337013:1":{"text":"그냥 다른 바다 일족들한테 우리가 해월 가문의 새로운 가족이라고 알리고, 다 같이 모여서 밥이나 거하게 먹으면 끝나는 거 아니었어?","source_cn":"难道不是说句话，告诉其他海裔咱是海月家的新家人，然后大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BA6C59BFCF4F211","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910337014:1":{"text":"어? 난 너희가 회유기에 대해 잘 알고 있어서 남은 줄 알았는데.","source_cn":"欸？我还以为你们很了解洄游季，才想要留下参加的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF72A086F483DE02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910337015:1":{"text":"그래도 괜찮아. 회유 의식은 아주 간단하거든. 한 번만 보면 어떻게 하는지 알 수 있을 거야.","source_cn":"不过也没关系，洄游仪式很简单的，看一次就知道该怎么做了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA2A72A09579D260","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910337016:1":{"text":"봐, 이제 곧 탄생의 순간이 시작될 거야!","source_cn":"看，繁衍就要开始了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD95C64B478426E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910337017:1":{"text":"一阵欢快的喧哗响起。你看到一位海裔抱着魔法素材，满怀欣喜地走向繁育池……","source_cn":"一阵欢快的喧哗响起。你看到一位海裔抱着魔法素材，满怀欣...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xC1ED6C3D6EAD013F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","